{"id":"13c327637bd1636b","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions.md","title":"The three induced obstructions for threshold graphs","display":"thm-thresholdgraphobstructions — The three induced obstructions for threshold graphs","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions","aliases":["27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions"],"display":"thm-thresholdgraphobstructions — The three induced obstructions for threshold graphs","depends_on":["[[27-df-thresholdgraph]]","[[27-df-graph]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.7 Theorems 9.29–9.30","source_printed_pages":"439–440","source_pdf_pages":"463–464","verification_status":"source-statements-and-proof-checked-corrected-order-indexing","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-thresholdgraphobstructions — The three induced obstructions for threshold graphs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa8f08f5040477a3\" href=\"?note=aa8f08f5040477a3\" title=\"27-df-thresholdgraph\">27-df-thresholdgraph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.7 Theorems 9.29–9.30"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"439–440"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"463–464"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statements-and-proof-checked-corrected-order-indexing"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=([n],E)\">\\(G=([n],E)\\)</span> 为有限简单图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{ThGraph}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa8f08f5040477a3\" href=\"?note=aa8f08f5040477a3\" title=\"27-df-thresholdgraph\">27-df-thresholdgraph</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Vert}\">\\(\\mathrm{Vert}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Edges}\">\\(\\mathrm{Edges}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,J\">\\(H,J\\)</span> 为任意有限简单图；诱导子图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H[S]\">\\(H[S]\\)</span> 和邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_H(v)\">\\(N_H(v)\\)</span> 仅对下式局部指定的合法顶点子集及顶点定义。图同构谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}\\)</span>、三个图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1,H_2,H_3\">\\(H_1,H_2,H_3\\)</span> 和消去谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Peel}\">\\(\\mathrm{Peel}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H[S]\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\cap S,\\{e\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H)\\mid e\\subseteq S\\})\\quad(\\mathrm{Graph}(H),\\ S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Vert}(H)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H[S]\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\cap S,\\{e\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H)\\mid e\\subseteq S\\})\\quad(\\mathrm{Graph}(H),\\ S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Vert}(H)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_H(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\mid\\{u,v\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H)\\}\\quad(\\mathrm{Graph}(H),\\ v\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_H(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\mid\\{u,v\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(H)\\}\\quad(\\mathrm{Graph}(H),\\ v\\in\\mathrm{Vert}(H)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}(H,J)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\phi:\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\mathrm{Vert}(J)\\;\\forall u,v\\in \\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\;\n\\left(\\{u,v\\}\\in \\mathrm{Edges}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\phi(u),\\phi(v)\\}\\in \\mathrm{Edges}(J)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Iso}(H,J)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\phi:\\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\mathrm{Vert}(J)\\;\\forall u,v\\in \\mathrm{Vert}(H)\\;\n\\left(\\{u,v\\}\\in \\mathrm{Edges}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\phi(u),\\phi(v)\\}\\in \\mathrm{Edges}(J)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_1\\coloneqq([4],\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{3,4\\}\\}),\\quad H_2\\coloneqq([4],\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{2,3\\},\\{3,4\\}\\}),\\quad H_3\\coloneqq([4],\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{2,3\\},\\{3,4\\},\\{4,1\\}\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_1\\coloneqq([4],\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{3,4\\}\\}),\\quad H_2\\coloneqq([4],\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{2,3\\},\\{3,4\\}\\}),\\quad H_3\\coloneqq([4],\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{2,3\\},\\{3,4\\},\\{4,1\\}\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Peel}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\n\\left(N_{G[\\{\\sigma(j)\\mid i\\le j\\le n\\}]}(\\sigma(i))\n\\in\\left\\{\\emptyset,\\{\\sigma(j)\\mid i&lt;j\\le n\\}\\right\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Peel}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\n\\left(N_{G[\\{\\sigma(j)\\mid i\\le j\\le n\\}]}(\\sigma(i))\n\\in\\left\\{\\emptyset,\\{\\sigma(j)\\mid i&lt;j\\le n\\}\\right\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Peel}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Peel}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;\\exists r\\in[3]\\;\\left(|S|=4\\land\\mathrm{Iso}(G[S],H_r)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;\\exists r\\in[3]\\;\\left(|S|=4\\land\\mathrm{Iso}(G[S],H_r)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorems 9.29–9.30，印刷 pp.439–440／PDF pp.463–464。每步删除当前图的孤立点或支配点。原书9.29(c)尾集混用原标号与排列位置，此处写成排列尾集消除歧义。邻域强度不可比可选两互不包含的邻点，四点诱导三种障碍之一；反向按孤立/支配递归构造权重。三种图均有两真点与两假点等和见证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-thresholdgraph","status":"resolved","id":"aa8f08f5040477a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-thresholdgraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-thresholdgraph","status":"resolved","id":"aa8f08f5040477a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$G=([n],E)$ 为有限简单图；$\\mathrm{ThGraph}$ 见 [[27-df-thresholdgraph]]，$\\mathrm{Graph}$、$\\mathrm{Vert}$、$\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graph]]。$H,J$ 为任意有限简单图；诱导子图 $H[S]$ 和邻域 $N_H(v)$ 仅对下式局部指定的合法顶点子集及顶点定义。图同构谓词 $\\mathrm{Iso}$、三个图 $H_1,H_2,H_3$ 和消去谓词 $\\mathrm{Peel}$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$G=([n],E)$ 为有限简单图；$\\mathrm{ThGraph}$ 见 [[27-df-thresholdgraph]]，$\\mathrm{Graph}$、$\\mathrm{Vert}$、$\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graph]]。$H,J$ 为任意有限简单图；诱导子图 $H[S]$ 和邻域 $N_H(v)$ 仅对下式局部指定的合法顶点子集及顶点定义。图同构谓词 $\\mathrm{Iso}$、三个图 $H_1,H_2,H_3$ 和消去谓词 $\\mathrm{Peel}$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"G=([n],E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Vert}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Edges}","display":false},{"tex":"H,J","display":false},{"tex":"H[S]","display":false},{"tex":"N_H(v)","display":fal